# Core Module API
# Version: 2026.10.21_1

## Endpoints

### Module Registration
POST /api/v1/modules/register
Request: {"module_name": "string", "version": "string", "endpoints": "array"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "module_id": "string", "message": "string"}

### Module Discovery
GET /api/v1/modules
Response: {"modules": [{"name": "string", "version": "string", "status": "active|inactive|error", "endpoints": "array"}]}

### Module Status
GET /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/status
Response: {"status": "active|inactive|error", "last_ping": "timestamp", "uptime": "number"}

### Send Message to Module
POST /api/v1/modules/{module_name}/message
Request: {"command": "string", "parameters": "object", "request_id": "string", "timeout": "number"}
Response: {"status": "sent|delivered|error", "response": "object", "request_id": "string"}

### Async Message Queue
POST /api/v1/queue/send
Request: {"module_name": "string", "command": "string", "parameters": "object", "priority": "low|normal|high"}
Response: {"queue_id": "string", "status": "queued"}

GET /api/v1/queue/{queue_id}/status
Response: {"status": "queued|processing|completed|error", "result": "object", "timestamp": "timestamp"}

### Cache Operations
POST /api/v1/cache/set
Request: {"key": "string", "value": "object", "ttl": "number"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

GET /api/v1/cache/get/{key}
Response: {"status": "found|not_found", "value": "object"}

DELETE /api/v1/cache/delete/{key}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "message": "string"}

### Health Check
GET /api/v1/health
Response: {"status": "healthy|degraded|unhealthy", "modules": "array", "queue_size": "number", "cache_size": "number"}

### Logging
POST /api/v1/log
Request: {"level": "DEBUG|INFO|WARNING|ERROR|CRITICAL", "module": "string", "message": "string", "context": "object"}
Response: {"status": "success|error", "log_id": "string"}

### Metrics
GET /api/v1/metrics
Response: {"queue_metrics": "object", "cache_metrics": "object", "module_metrics": "object"}

## Message Format
All messages between modules have the following structure:
{
  "from": "module_name",
  "to": "module_name",
  "command": "string",
  "parameters": "object",
  "request_id": "uuid",
  "timestamp": "ISO8601",
  "priority": "low|normal|high",
  "retry_count": "number"
}

## Error Codes
- 1000: Module not found
- 1001: Module not registered
- 1002: Module unavailable
- 1003: Invalid message format
- 1004: Queue overflow
- 1005: Timeout
- 1006: Cache error
- 2000: Internal server error
